  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0: BREAKING - DecodeInboundMessage now returns ErrorOr<InboundResult> instead of a (waId, displayName, BaseMessage) tuple, to support business-scoped user IDs (contacts with no visible phone number). Added Contact.UserId, Profile.Username, BaseMessage.FromUserId, and IWApi.RequestContactInfo for prompting cold contacts to share their number. v1.0.2: Added graceful handling for inbound message status updates (delivered/read/etc) via MessageStatus without throwing errors; improved webhook decoding robustness.",
